      "content": "but it doesn't feel like that. it feels like every time i try to help, i just make it harder. i'm constantly stressed, i'm always tired, and i'm just dragging them down into my own misery. if i wasn't here, everything would probably be so much lighter for them. they could just... breathe. they wouldn't have to worry about me all the time.",
